invite each panelist to talk

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.378
about why they are personally
excited about serverless.

00:01:31.378 --> 00:01:33.420
And I'll go last, so why
don't you start, Morgan?

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.160
Why are you excited
about serverless?

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.180
MORGAN HALLMON: Sure.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.793
So I'm super excited
about serverless.

00:01:37.793 --> 00:01:39.960
I mean, obviously, I'm a
serverless product manager,

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:40.950
so I'm somewhat biased.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:44.490
But you know, that dev
keynote yesterday was called

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:45.885
